          {
            "typeName": "notesText",
            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "The README.txt file gives an overview of all uploaded files:\n- Data files: Containing all processed data (in xlsx and csv);\n- Belonging codebooks: Containing lists of all variables, their description and unit/levels (in xlsx and csv);\n- R-scripts: Containing scripts for the final CCA;\n- Derivated data files for statistical analysis (only in xlsx);\n- Belonging codebooks: Containing lists of all variables, their description and unit/levels (in xlsx and csv).\nPQs' coordinates are withheld for protection but are available upon reasonable request.\nPlease contact the corresponding author for additional guidance if needed."
